COMPILATION OF: E46M9

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M9

   1 a 0000 E46M9:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] CHARACTER VARYING beside CHARACTER FIXED, BOTH
   4 a 0006      ORDERS, both routes. The tail is ?PNCOP for both classes, so an
   5 a 0006      order bug cannot hide in the tail; it can only hide in the
   6 a 0006      helper pair, and the two orders are spelled separately. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, c char(14);
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M9OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v,c);
  10 c 0046   put file(outf) list(c,v);
  11 c 0069   put list(v,c);
  12 c 0089   put list(c,v);
  13 c 00A9   close file(outf);
  14 a 00AF end E46M9;

CODE SIZE = 00B2
DATA AREA = 002C
FREE SYMS = 389D
END  COMPILATION
